# Copy to `.dev.vars` for `wrangler dev`; set the real value in production with
#   wrangler secret put ASSEMBLYAI_API_KEY
# `.dev.vars` is gitignored. Leave the line below empty and paste the key there.
#
# The key stays server-side: the browser only ever receives a temporary token
# minted from it, good for one connection for TOKEN_TTL_SECONDS.
ASSEMBLYAI_API_KEY=
